div>\n            </div>\n            <h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold mb-2\">Tone Control</h3>\n            <p class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm leading-relaxed\">Switch modes instantly. From casual Slack replies to boardroom formal.</p>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"bg-[#EAEAEA] rounded-2xl p-6\">\n            <div class=\"flex justify-between text-xs text-gray-500 mb-8 uppercase tracking-widest\">\n                <span>FIG 02</span>\n                <span>GLOBAL_BAND</span>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"bg-white/60 rounded-xl p-8 flex justify-center items-center mb-8 shadow-sm\">\n                <div class=\"relative w-40 h-16 bg-white rounded-lg border-2 border-gray-200 flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden\">\n                    <div class=\"absolute inset-x-0 h-1 bg-red-500 top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-1/2 mx-auto rounded-full z-10\"></div>\n                    <div class=\"w-full flex justify-between px-4 text-gray-300 text-xs\"><span>|</span><span>|</span><span>|</span><span>|</span><span>|</span></div>\n                    <div class=\"absolute bottom-1 w-6 h-6 bg-gray-100 rounded-full border-2 border-gray-300\"></div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold mb-2\">Works Everywhere</h3>\n            <p class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm leading-relaxed\">Native integrations for Gmail, Outlook, and Superhuman.</p>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"bg-[#EAEAEA] rounded-2xl p-6\">\n            <div class=\"flex justify-between text-xs text-gray-500 mb-8 uppercase tracking-widest\">\n                <span>FIG 03</span>\n                <span>ENCRYPTION</span>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"bg-white/60 rounded-xl p-8 flex flex-col justify-center items-center mb-8 shadow-sm\">\n                <div class=\"w-full h-12 bg-white border-2 border-gray-100 rounded flex items-center px-4 space-x-1 relative overflow-hidden\">\n                    <div class=\"w-1 h-2 bg-gray-800 rounded-full\"></div><div class=\"w-1 h-2 bg-gray-300 rounded-full\"></div><div class=\"w-1 h-2 bg-gray-800 rounded-full\"></div><div class=\"w-1 h-2 bg-gray-300 rounded-full\"></div>\n                    <div class=\"w-1 h-2 bg-gray-800 rounded-full\"></div><div class=\"w-1 h-2 bg-gray-300 rounded-full\"></div><div class=\"w-1 h-2 bg-gray-800 rounded-full\"></div><div class=\"w-1 h-2 bg-gray-300 rounded-full\"></div>\n                    <div class=\"absolute right-0 top-0 h-full w-1/2 bg-gradient-to-l from-white to-transparent\"></div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"flex items-center text-xs text-gray-500 mt-3\">\n                    <svg class=\"w-4 h-4 mr-1 text-green-500\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M12 15v2m-6 4h12a2 2 0 002-2v-6a2 2 0 00-2-2H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v6a2 2 0 002 2zm10-10V7a4 4 0 00-8 0v4h8z\"></path></svg>\n                    SECURE\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold mb-2\">Private By Design</h3>\n            <p class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm leading-relaxed\">Enterprise-grade encryption. Your data never trains our models.</p>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8\">\n        \n        <div class=\"bg-[#EAEAEA] rounded-2xl p-6 flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center md:items-start space-y-6 md:space-y-0 md:space-x-8\">\n            <div class=\"w-full md:w-1/3 bg-white/60 rounded-xl p-8 flex justify-center items-center shadow-sm aspect-square\">\n                <div class=\"relative w-24 h-24 rounded-full border-4 border-gray-200 flex items-center justify-center\">\n                    <div class=\"absolute w-1 h-10 bg-red-500 origin-bottom bottom-1/2 transform rotate-45 rounded-full\"></div>\n                    <div class=\"w-3 h-3 bg-white border-2 border-red-500 rounded-full z-10\"></div>\n                    <span class=\"absolute bottom-4 text-xs text-gray-400\">12h</span>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"w-full md:w-2/3\">\n                <div class=\"flex justify-between text-xs text-gray-500 mb-4 uppercase tracking-widest\">\n                    <span>FIG 04</span>\n                    <span>VELOCITY</span>\n                </div>\n                <h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold mb-4\">Saves 12h / week</h3>\n                <p class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm leading-relaxed\">Reclaim your mornings. Typewriter handles the bulk, so you can focus on the big decisions. Speed without sacrifice.</p>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"bg-[#EAEAEA] rounded-2xl p-6 flex flex-col-reverse md:flex-row items-center md:items-start space-y-6 space-y-reverse md:space-y-0 md:space-x-8\">\n            <div class=\"w-full md:w-2/3\">\n                <div class=\"flex justify-between text-xs text-gray-500 mb-4 uppercase tracking-widest md:hidden\">\n                    <span>FIG 05</span>\n                    <span>THROUGHPUT</span>\n                </div>\n                <h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold mb-4\">500+ Emails / Month</h3>\n                <p class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm leading-relaxed\">Built for high volume. Whether it's support tickets, outreach, or internal comms, Typewriter never gets tired.</p>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"w-full md:w-1/3 bg-white/60 rounded-xl p-8 flex flex-col justify-center items-center shadow-sm aspect-square relative\">\n                <div class=\"hidden md:flex absolute top-4 left-4 right-4 justify-between text-xs text-gray-500 uppercase tracking-widest\">\n                    <span>FIG 05</span>\n                    <span>THROUGHPUT</span>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"flex items-center space-x-2 bg-white border-2 border-gray-200 rounded-lg p-2 mt-6\">\n                    <div class=\"w-8 h-10 bg-gray-100 rounded flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-xl shadow-inner\">5</div>\n                    <div class=\"w-8 h-10 bg-gray-100 rounded flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-xl shadow-inner\">0</div>\n                    <div class=\"w-8 h-10 bg-gray-100 rounded flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-xl shadow-inner\">0</div>\n                    <div class=\"text-gray-400 font-bold text-xl\">+</div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"mt-16 flex items-center space-x-2\">\n        <div class=\"w-2 h-2 bg-red-500 rounded-full\"></div>\n        <span class=\"text-xs text-gray-500 uppercase tracking-widest\">WALL OF FAME</span>\n    </div>\n\n</body>\n</html>"
